{"mode":"words","text":"Viršuje matai tekstą būtent taip, kaip jį rodo programa. Kiekvienas žodis yra maža kortelė: viršuje – žodis tiksline kalba, po juo – jo reikšmė tavo gimtąja kalba – žodis po žodžio, tiksline kalbos tvarka. Toliau pateikiamas visas sakinys, sklandžiai išverstas. Kalbų, kuriose naudojama kitokia rašyba, atveju pridedama eilutė su transkripcija, kad galėtum viską perskaityti. Bakstelėk žodį: balsas tęs grojimą būtent nuo tos vietos.","words":[{"s":0,"e":480},{"s":528,"e":800},{"s":840,"e":1120},{"s":1160,"e":1520},{"s":1547,"e":1800},{"s":1813,"e":1920},{"s":1960,"e":2001},{"s":2053,"e":2240},{"s":2311,"e":3040},{"s":3400,"e":4080},{"s":4160,"e":4560},{"s":4600,"e":4720},{"s":4747,"e":5040},{"s":5072,"e":5680},{"s":5920,"e":7040},{"s":7240,"e":7440},{"s":7480,"e":7760},{"s":7800,"e":8240},{"s":8300,"e":8880},{"s":9013,"e":9280},{"s":9360,"e":9680},{"s":9840,"e":10000},{"s":10053,"e":10160},{"s":10187,"e":10600},{"s":10620,"e":10800},{"s":10860,"e":11280},{"s":11340,"e":11680},{"s":12120,"e":12560},{"s":12640,"e":13040},{"s":13093,"e":13200},{"s":13240,"e":13720},{"s":13780,"e":14240},{"s":14300,"e":14720},{"s":14747,"e":15280},{"s":15840,"e":16640},{"s":16680,"e":17200},{"s":17253,"e":17520},{"s":17560,"e":18160},{"s":18240,"e":18800},{"s":18880,"e":19680},{"s":19960,"e":20987},{"s":21000,"e":21280},{"s":21307,"e":21760},{"s":21800,"e":22160},{"s":22213,"e":22720},{"s":22800,"e":23200},{"s":23227,"e":23760},{"s":23800,"e":24240},{"s":24320,"e":24373},{"s":24400,"e":25600},{"s":25640,"e":25760},{"s":25800,"e":26160},{"s":26220,"e":26480},{"s":26544,"e":27360},{"s":27660,"e":28987},{"s":29013,"e":30160},{"s":30240,"e":30640},{"s":30680,"e":30880},{"s":30920,"e":31360},{"s":31440,"e":31920},{"s":31947,"e":32080},{"s":32133,"e":32320},{"s":32400,"e":32960}]}